{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and take then process it. Otherwise, scan for the object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = FindTakeAndProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
    "BT": {
